    "created_at": "2023-08-14T20:15:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-14T20:15:52Z",
    "body": "Hm, that's reasonable I suppose. I might tighten my own handling to allow `=` in unquoted attributes for the well-known URL-taking attributes on certain tags (`a href`, `img src`, etc) but otherwise flag it as an error.",
